    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning two-bedroom first-floor open-plan apartment with a stylish interior, ample storage space and a sunny balcony.\r\n\r\nThis amazing property features an inviting entrance hall with tiled flooring, a hot press, and a convenient storage room. To the left of the hallway is the generous, fully tiled family bathroom, fitted with well-maintained sanitary ware and a heated towel radiator. The master bedroom boasts laminate flooring, a stunning fully tiled en-suite, and a spacious walk-in wardrobe. Both the master and second bedroom are beautifully presented and enjoy the added benefit of Juliet balconies. The apartment enjoys a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, which opens onto the sunny balcony, creating the perfect space to relax or entertain guests. The property is completed by a spacious kitchen featuring stylish cabinetry, ample countertop and cupboard space, splashback tiling, tiled flooring, and a separate utility room to the rear. This stunning apartment also benefits from a designated parking space and is serviced by a lift. This spacious energy efficient apartment is a must see!!\r\n\r\nLandscape court is ideally located within distance of excellent local shopping and amenities such as the popular Dundrum Town Centre. Bushy Park provides leisurely walks along the river Dodder linking Orwell and Dartry Parks. Reliable bus routes provide easy access to the city and not forgetting easy access to the M50 motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
